# Noodle cart. Sells food, gossip about Jacob and the thugs (E2).
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('Killed(jacob_thorne)')
goto: JacobDead

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Noodles, ten sat. Gossip is free if you buy noodles.
#
o_text: Seen a man with pink hair and shift tacts?
o_id: suki_pinky
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(payback)') && !HasFlag('pinky_found')
o_goto: SukiPinky
#
o_text: (Buy noodles.) Ten.
o_id: suki_buy
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 10)
o_goto: Buy
#
o_text: Who runs this street?
o_id: suki_street
o_goto: Street
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: suki_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Buy
npc: (A paper bowl, too hot to hold.) Jacob Thorne owes half this street. His boys collect on Fridays. Today is not Friday, so I'm smiling.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 10)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'binge', 1)
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: suki_buy_back
o_goto: Default

name: Street
npc: Jacob, for now. He keeps a safe behind the painting, everybody knows, nobody is stupid enough. His thugs stand by the east door. The beggar by the terminal sees more than all of us.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: suki_street_back
o_goto: Default

name: JacobDead
npc: Jacob's gone and his boys went wild. Two carts robbed this week. Someone moved into his house before the body was cold. (She lowers her voice.) Whoever did it, the street isn't better. Just different.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Come back hungry.
effect: EndConversation

name: SukiPinky
npc: Pinky? Bought noodles with shaking hands, then went south to the wall to hide with the scavengers. Everybody knows. He's not good at hiding.
effect: SetFlag('pinky_found')
effect: EndConversation
